## Features
- 200 warm white LEDs with 8 lighting modes;
- 3-piece rattan-look reindeer family;
- IP44-rated body for sheltered outdoor use;
- Daily timer with 6H on/18H off cycle;
- Adds festive charm to patios and pathways;

## Information
Transform your home with this 3-piece light-up reindeer family. Crafted with realistic brown PP rattan, it features 200 warm white LEDs, 8 modes and a daily timer. IP44-rated for sheltered outdoor use with a 4.5V low-voltage adapter.
